00:17:38.955 --> 00:17:42.543
♫ I find my rainbow flag LGBTQ business

00:17:42.543 --> 00:17:45.044
♫ Oh yes, I got so much love to give

00:17:45.044 --> 00:17:48.158
♫ I look at the colors it's like roygbiv

