00:18:10.524 --> 00:18:13.694
Oh my gosh, how do you do that?

00:18:13.694 --> 00:18:14.527
Woo!

00:18:18.481 --> 00:18:19.898
That was awesome.

00:18:22.102 --> 00:18:23.901
Man oh man, that was fantastic.

00:18:23.901 --> 00:18:25.266
- This is some serious
business right here.

00:18:25.266 --> 00:18:27.516
(laughing)

00:18:28.474 --> 00:18:29.928
- [Lin] Are we in the
Rose Garden right now?

00:18:29.928 --> 00:18:33.711
- We are, this is the
Rose Garden right here.

00:18:33.711 --> 00:18:35.266
It must be a little nerve wracking.

00:18:35.266 --> 00:18:36.945
I hope I don't drop these cards.

00:18:36.945 --> 00:18:37.778
- [Man] You ready, guys?

00:18:37.778 --> 00:18:38.611
